* CA3260 BiMOS dual op-amp, MOSFET input and CMOS rail-to-rail output, 16 V max (our model from Intersil's sheet)
* Built by Solum Builder from Intersil CA3260 data sheet FN1266 Rev. 7.00 (December 2009), at V+ = 15 V, V– = 0 (±7.5 V) (D-162)
.subckt CA3260 1 2 3 4 5
* pins: + - V+ V- out. Built by Solum Builder from the sheet's typical figures (D-162)
Rin 1 2 1e+12
Rc1 1 mid 1e12
Rc2 2 mid 1e12
Emid mid 4 3 4 0.5
Bgm mid g I=1e-05*tanh(1.68278*(V(1)-V(2)))
R1 g mid 1.90161e+10
C1 g mid 6.09756e-13
Vhp 3 hp DC 0.035
Vhn hn 4 DC 0.035
Dhi g hp DCLAMP
Dlo hn g DCLAMP
Ebuf b 0 g 0 1
Rp b p 1000
Cp p 0 1.8049e-11
Eout o 0 p 0 1
Vsense o o2 0
Rout o2 5 1280
Bsrc 3 0 I=max(i(Vsense),0)
Bsnk 0 4 I=max(-i(Vsense),0)
Iq 3 4 DC 0.0045
.model DCLAMP D(is=1e-15 n=0.05)
.ends
